      "text": ["It's... is that a new engine? Wow!", "Okay, yeah, that might, that might actually make a difference. Pop it in!", "Okay, the gut pain is gone. Thanks,", "still though, we've got more work to do. Go check out the first floor.", "Meanwhile, I'm gonna get used to all this new horsepower."],
