      "text": ["Whatcha got there friend? Oh, oh wait a minute, is that a new strap?", "Okay, now we're talking. Put that in. I can spin the drum to the speed of light with this thing.", "Great work, we're getting closer. Just have to stay strong and don't give up now."],
