      "id": "cutscene_5",
      "triggers": ["cutscene_fix_4"],
      "sets": [],
      "text": ["That's good stuff! Real good stuff!", "Okay, you can leave that box here with me and I'll take care of...", "Wait... wait...", "I almost forgot! There's one last thing we're missing.", "You might not know about it, but this house is sitting on an ancient complex cave system.", "The socks have gone rogue completely and are looking for waste out of the house.", "You can't let that happen! Go check out the dung... eon, uh...", "cave system, yeah? And see what's what, okay?"],
